---
import Card from '../Card.astro'
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-2" title="Sobre mí" titleEn="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      <span data-lang-es>Soy desarrollador de software de Colombia, enfocado en backend y soluciones full stack para procesos de negocio.</span>
      <span data-lang-en hidden>I am a software developer from Colombia focused on backend and full stack solutions for business processes.</span>
      <br />
      <br />
      <span data-lang-es>Mis herramientas principales incluyen:</span><span data-lang-en hidden>My main tools include:</span>
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc">
        <li>C# <span data-lang-es>y</span><span data-lang-en hidden>and</span> .NET 8</li>
        <li>ASP.NET Core <span data-lang-es>y</span><span data-lang-en hidden>and</span> REST APIs</li>
        <li>SQL Server <span data-lang-es>y</span><span data-lang-en hidden>and</span> T-SQL</li>
        <li>JWT, RSA y OWASP</li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      <span data-lang-es>También comparto contenido sobre programación en YouTube y exploro Android, Flutter e integraciones con IA.</span>
      <span data-lang-en hidden>I also share programming content on YouTube and explore Android, Flutter, and AI integrations.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
